    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:e22a1f40b4b37bca",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ff1dd61689d5b7c395d902577f9e8d81728175ccb5aa36130fc7141f17778eff",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9trov9-0oxzxedywb",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the bus station for a group journey to Cusco on a dedicated tourist coach, with stops along the way and lunch in Sicuani. Arrive at the Cusco bus station in the evening and transfer to the hotel."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:6c0e6dbe82327d99",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7b317654423b86b0e464124c48e264564820716baa4bfe8b61ae68ad586355eb",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw9trov9-0oxzxedywb",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Next, head to the bus station for a group transfer to Cusco on a dedicated tourist coach. Stops include Andahuaylillas, known as the Sistine Chapel of South America, and Raqchi, an Inca administrative site. Lunch is in Sicuani. The next stops are La Raya (4,400 metres above sea level), a roadside market with a mountain backdrop, and Pukara, a centre of the pre-Inca culture of the same name. Arrive at the Cusco bus station in the evening and transfer to the hotel."
    },
    {
